                                <h3>Event Detail</h3>
                                <p>Skillbook Skill Development Centre organized an insightful Digital Marketing Workshop on June 13 and 14, 2024, at its Rohini Sector-6 location, near Visram Chowk. The workshop was attended by students from ITI Narela, COPA, and CHNM Batches, eager to learn valuable digital marketing skills that can enhance their careers.
                                    This free workshop aimed to provide students with knowledge about digital marketing and how it can be a game-changer in today's technology-driven world. Students were taught the practical applications of digital marketing and how mastering these skills could help them generate extra income beyond their regular jobs. They also gained insights into the growing importance of digital marketing in various industries and how staying updated with these skills is crucial for career growth.
                                    The workshop spanned two days, filled with interactive sessions where students were actively engaged with Skillbook’s expert tutors. By the end of the workshop, the students not only gained confidence in their new skills but also expressed their gratitude towards Skillbook, leaving with smiles and a sense of achievement.
                                    This event marks another successful initiative by Skillbook in providing free educational opportunities aimed at student development and welfare.
                                    </p>
                                <a class="theam_btn btn2 text_white bg_color" href="/#contactIncq">Join Us</a>
